  "details": "I’ve been dealing with this issue for a month now. For some reason, everyone’s chat bubbles are completely transparent and barely readable. I’ve tried everything I can think of: tweaking my VRChat settings, rejoining the world, switching to a different world, restarting the game, deleting all my cache, checking for computer updates, and even rebooting my PC. I’ve also tested with friends in other worlds and game lobbies (like Murder 4), but the problem persists.  When I send a message, it appears crystal‑clear, but as soon as someone else sends a message, their chat bubble stays transparent and hard to read. I’m pretty sure it isn’t a world‑shader issue  it seems to be a bug that still needs to be addressed.",
